<p>Rubén Rocha Moya, governor of Mexico’s northwestern Sinaloa state, said he would temporarily step down after the United States indicted him on drug trafficking allegations tied to the Sinaloa Cartel. A mayor in Sinaloa also said he would step down; both officials belong to President Claudia Sheinbaum’s Morena party. The allegations involve a ruling-party governor, and the Financial Times reported that Sheinbaum refused to hand over Rocha and nine officials to the United States on U.S. drug charges.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/a8lRB_C5luGSpG0phU5lDOfa_wp5ThB1I5qP1kHaOkGJbyHHkeRU6Aqt0HXV0Pu794c0nXPbXduKc7YVBCpwSj4N9So0XNXWlhiRgqmiH196zZv0CXWF4qIMmSGFn5uyB2IXzo26U59suB8FQwz2gpNKqo66VGkMQVdHblTatZ0awrPBzAM2MFAnmAhCQMbjj4Ryy3wIPI_nzjgG' alt='Rubén Rocha Moya, the governor of the Mexican state of Sinaloa, said he had decided to take “a temporary leave of absence.”' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Case scope: CNN en Español and Nation reports described a five-count indictment against Rocha and nine current or former high-ranking Mexican officials; AP-based accounts said the U.S. charged the governor, a mayor and eight other politicians and security officers.</li><li>Political ties: Rocha is a longtime ally of former President Andrés Manuel López Obrador, Sheinbaum’s predecessor and mentor.</li><li>Alleged exchange: The U.S. case alleges a conspiracy to distribute large quantities of drugs in U.S. territory in exchange for support and bribes; DW described the alleged bribes as totaling millions of dollars.</li><li>File chronology: La Silla Rota said the U.S. file spans Rocha’s 2021 campaign through a formal extradition request in 2026.</li></ul><blockquote>Clean conscience - Rubén Rocha Moya</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Rubén Rocha Moya: In televised remarks, Rocha said he was innocent and described the U.S. charges as a political attack on Morena’s movement. (<a href='https://tribune.com.pk/story/2606096/mexican-governor-steps-aside-after-us-accusations-of-cartel-ties'>The Express Tribune</a>)</li><li>Mexican federal prosecutors: CNN en Español reported that the FGR opened an inquiry into the U.S. allegations, including drug trafficking and weapons claims. (<a href='https://krdo.com/news/2026/05/02/el-gobernador-de-sinaloa-pide-separarse-del-cargo-mientras-fiscalia-de-mexico-investiga-acusacion-de-ee-uu-por-narcotrafico/'>KRDO</a>)</li><li>President Claudia Sheinbaum: The Financial Times reported that Sheinbaum refused to hand over Rocha and nine officials to the United States on U.S. drug charges. (<a href='https://www.ft.com/content/cc580d74-8adc-47df-b7ee-43767ee6572a'>Financial Times</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/mexican-governor-mayor-indicted-us-drug-trafficking-step-132600642'>Mexican governor and mayor indicted by US for drug trafficking step down</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/mexican-governor-and-mayor-step-down-after-u-s-drug-trafficking-indictments'>Mexican governor and mayor step down after U.S. drug trafficking indictments</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/02/world/americas/mexico-governor-corruption-ruben-rocha.html'>Mexican Governor Accused by U.S. of Aiding Drug Cartel Steps Down</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/mexican-governor-indicted-by-us-steps-down/a-77021079'>Mexican governor indicted by US steps down</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://tribune.com.pk/story/2606096/mexican-governor-steps-aside-after-us-accusations-of-cartel-ties'>Mexican governor steps aside after US accusations of cartel ties</a> - tribune.com.pk</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/05/02/mexican-governor-accused-by-us-of-drug-trafficking-temporarily-steps-down_6753063_4.html'>Mexican governor accused by US of drug trafficking temporarily steps down</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://krdo.com/news/2026/05/02/governor-of